  "notes": "Sizes are inline variants; the 270M size followed on 2025-08-14. Announced together with ShieldGemma 2, a separate image safety classifier built on Gemma 3 (not recorded here). Quantization-aware trained (QAT) checkpoints were published later. The announcement says Gemma 3 is built from the same research and technology as Gemini 2.0, and the technical report says all sizes are trained with knowledge distillation without naming the teacher model, so no derived-from relation is recorded."
